      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我说啊，鸟宝可梦\n不是有各种各样的吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118BF4554AFF0C9E1F5B9D53EF68A6000A4E0D662F6709540479CD5404683776845417FF1F00100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但我就是喜欢\n波波、比比鸟和大比鸟！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4662115C31662F559C6B22000A6CE26CE230016BD46BD49E1F548C59276BD49E1FFF0100100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我加入现在的快递公司，\n也是因为公司的标志是鸟宝可梦！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n……虽然标志上的是烈箭鹰。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621152A0516573B0572876845FEB9012516C53F8FF0C000A4E5F662F56E04E3A516C53F8768468075FD7662F9E1F5B9D53EF68A6FF0100100001BE01000A20262026867D713668075FD74E0A7684662F70C87BAD9E70300200100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还有，大比鸟它们使用的\n飞翔这个招式也很厉害！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD86709FF0C59276BD49E1F5B834EEC4F7F75287684000A98DE7FD48FD94E2A62DB5F0F4E5F5F8853895BB3FF0100100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要不要尝尝\n波波、比比鸟和大比鸟的飞翔攻击？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6089814E0D89815C1D5C1D000A6CE26CE230016BD46BD49E1F548C59276BD49E1F768498DE7FD4653B51FBFF1F00100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想和魅力超群的大比鸟它们对战的话，\n就来跟我说一声吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F3548C9B45529B8D857FA4768459276BD49E1F5B834EEC5BF9621876848BDDFF0C000A5C3167658DDF62118BF44E0058F05427FF0100100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和我的大比鸟它们打一场，\n应该就能体会到它们的魅力了。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n你当然要打一场的吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C6211768459276BD49E1F5B834EEC62534E00573AFF0C000A5E948BE55C3180FD4F534F1A52305B834EEC76849B45529B4E86300200100001BE00000A4F605F537136898162534E00573A76845427FF1F00100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "打一场！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62534E00573AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来打一场嘛！\n见识一下大比鸟它们的魅力嘛！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "676562534E00573A561BFF01000A89C18BC64E004E0B59276BD49E1F5B834EEC76849B45529B561BFF0100100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好～嘞，先上场的是波波！\n飞向高空吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597DFF5E561EFF0C51484E0A573A7684662F6CE26CE2FF01000A98DE54119AD87A7A5427FF0100100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我虽然打输了，但应该让你感受到\n大比鸟它们的魅力了吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211867D713662538F934E86FF0C4F465E948BE58BA94F60611F53D75230000A59276BD49E1F5B834EEC76849B45529B4E865427FF0100100002011401440000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要在送快递的同时，\n在整个密阿雷传播大比鸟的魅力！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕń",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
